[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "ruy-berlin 4.O-O"]
[Name "4...d6: into the Steinitz"]

4... d6 { Guards e5, but it pins the c6 knight to the king, as in the Steinitz. }
5. d4 { The same answer: hit e5 at once. [%cal Gd4e5] }
5... exd4
6. Nxd4 Bd7
7. Nc3 { The Steinitz line with Black's knight on f6. } *
